From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 17:50:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): retain adaptive main windows and soften press light

Shared window continuity, passive commit sampling and glow with Mihon 0078. User preview.29 traces show two Activity recreations, a 116ms transition frame dominated by scheduling delay, and near-89Hz flings despite persistent perceived stutter. Let MainActivity handle size/orientation configurations, feed live Configuration into Compose and reapply the existing tablet policy; restrict its resource override to the tablet breakpoint instead of freezing the whole configuration. Other restart causes and reader/player Activity policies remain unchanged. Default light recording passively samples at most one outstanding frame-commit callback, no faster than 2Hz, and logs 2s summaries; stop unregisters, stale delivery is inert and views are weakly held. Submission is not GPU completion or visible presentation. Mihon exports format6 with its explicit detailed mode retained; Anikku compact format3 keeps its own adapter and DI/TV policy. Press/release use equal-speed 260ms progress with smoothstep brightness, no forced peak, and a cached wide Gaussian halo without a bright plateau edge. Phone validation remains required; no definitive single-root-cause or FPS gain claim.
